<figure class="chapter-visual representability-diagram">
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创静态示意：密度允许域与可表示性</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original static diagram: admissible density domains and representability</span>
  </figcaption>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 420" role="img" aria-labelledby="rep-title rep-desc">
    <title id="rep-title">Schematic density domains for constrained-search density functional theory</title>
    <desc id="rep-desc">A nested schematic distinguishes normalized regular trial functions, finite-energy N-representable densities, and ground-state ensemble v-representable densities. A dashed pure-state domain indicates that pure-state and ensemble formulations must not be conflated.</desc>

    <rect x="35" y="35" width="690" height="335" rx="24" class="rep-domain rep-domain--trial" />
    <text x="60" y="70">候选函数域：n ≥ 0, ∫n = N，加上声明的正则性</text>
    <text x="60" y="94" lang="en">Trial-function domain with normalization and declared regularity</text>

    <ellipse cx="390" cy="225" rx="265" ry="120" class="rep-domain rep-domain--nrep" />
    <text x="390" y="155" text-anchor="middle">D_N：有限内部能的系综 N-representable 密度</text>
    <text x="390" y="180" text-anchor="middle" lang="en">finite-internal-energy ensemble N-representable densities</text>

    <ellipse cx="405" cy="240" rx="165" ry="72" class="rep-domain rep-domain--vrep" />
    <text x="405" y="230" text-anchor="middle">V_N：某个允许外势的基态</text>
    <text x="405" y="255" text-anchor="middle">ensemble v-representable densities</text>

    <path d="M 210 275 C 255 135 520 120 585 265 C 520 340 290 350 210 275 Z" class="rep-domain rep-domain--pure" />
    <text x="565" y="325" text-anchor="end">纯态 N-representable 域（示意）</text>
    <text x="565" y="347" text-anchor="end" lang="en">pure-state N-representable domain (schematic)</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>学习目的：</strong>把“归一化函数”“由某个允许量子态产生”“由某个外势的基态产生”分成不同判定。Levy 搜索在声明的 $N$-representable 域上定义，不要求先知道该密度对应哪个外势。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Learning purpose:</strong> separate normalization, production by an admissible quantum state, and production as a ground-state density of an admissible external potential. Levy search is defined on a declared $N$-representable domain without first identifying a generating potential.</p>
    <p><strong>输入与输出：</strong>该图没有数值控件；输入是所选择的函数空间、纯态或系综定义以及有限能量条件，输出是逻辑包含关系。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Input and output:</strong> the diagram has no numerical controls. Its inputs are the chosen function space, pure-state or ensemble convention, and finite-energy conditions; its output is a logical-domain distinction.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>图中 $V_N$ 位于声明的系综 $N$-representable 域内；纯态与系综标签不得互换；外层几何面积不表示测度、概率或严格包含的“大小”。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> $V_N$ lies inside the declared ensemble $N$-representable domain; pure-state and ensemble labels remain distinct; geometric areas carry no measure, probability, or quantitative set-size meaning.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>这是集合关系的教学示意。精确的包含、闭包与稠密性取决于势类、函数空间、纯态/系综选择和相互作用；图形不构成集合论证明。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> this is a teaching schematic. Exact inclusions, closures, and density properties depend on the potential class, function space, pure/ensemble convention, and interaction; the drawing is not a set-theoretic proof.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

